{
  "title": "Jewel Toned Dense Polish Tarragon Stew",
  "description": "A rich and indulgent Polish stew featuring tarragon leaves, perfect for a cold winter's night, this dish is slow-cooked to bring out the deep flavors of the ingredients.",
