  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, heat 2 tablespoons of oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they are translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the mushrooms, carrots, and potatoes, and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the tarragon leaves, vegetable broth, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the stew to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Stir in the sour cream and cook for an additional 10 minutes, or until the stew has thickened slightly.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh dill."
  ],
